[00:02.400]There is no time to spare, and
{"时间所剩无几"}
[00:07.960]The stage has been set.
{"舞台已然搭好"}
[00:10.060]I cannot hold back the need to know.
{"我无法抑制求知的渴望"}
[00:12.710]Curiosity got to me.
{"好奇心占据了我"}
[00:17.460]The question's been asked.
{"问题已被提出"}
[00:19.070]I can't take it back again.
{"我再也无法收回"}
[00:22.970]The falling stars align,
{"坠落的星辰连成一线"}
[00:24.870]With darkness close behind.
{"黑暗紧随其后"}
[00:28.270]Locked up in my mind,
{"囚禁于我的脑海"}
[00:30.570]With solace, I'm confined.
{"与孤独相伴"}
[00:32.420]Can destiny define
{"命运能否定义"}
[00:34.420]The silence in the night?
{"这夜的寂静"}
[00:37.170]And so, I've become
{"于是我变成了"}
[00:39.970]A puppet in the dark.
{"黑暗中的傀儡"}
[00:42.530]I know I've made up my mind
{"我知道我已下定决心"}
[00:45.680]For something to do,
{"为了有所作为"}
[00:48.930]To clean out all of their stupid rules.
{"清除他们愚蠢的规则"}
[00:52.030]Been avoided for so long,
{"逃避了太久"}
[00:56.480]I'm tired of lies
{"厌倦了谎言"}
[00:58.630]And moving on for the truth.
{"只为追寻真相"}
[01:01.990]Simple, like a drop of sun,
{"简单如阳光一滴"}
[01:04.340]And the world spun on, but upside-down.
{"世界继续旋转 却天翻地覆"}
[01:06.290]Is this what they'd call a miracle?
{"这就是他们所谓的奇迹吗"}
[01:11.240]Falling, each and every one.
{"坠落 每一个都是"}
[01:14.140]Like a house of cards, it's been undone.
{"如同纸牌屋 轰然倒塌"}
[01:16.840]Taking a leap without sound...
{"无声地纵身一跃……"}
[01:20.140]I'll shout just a bit louder, fight a bit harder.
{"我要再大声呼喊　再奋力一战"}
[01:24.250]I will go on. I'm undefeated.
{"我会继续前行　永不败退"}
[01:26.300]Can't feel the hunger. I won't go under.
{"感受不到饥饿　我绝不会沉沦"}
[01:29.400]I'm my own person. I feel it.
{"我是自己的主宰　我能感觉到"}
[01:32.150]Little bit stronger, going on farther.
{"再坚强一点　走得更远些"}
[01:35.000]No longer do I fear the darkness.
{"我不再畏惧黑暗"}
[01:38.170]I can fly beyond the distant, new horizon forever.
{"我能永远飞越遥远的新地平线"}
[01:45.460]All this time, reality's been fake.
{"一直以来　现实都是虚假的"}
[01:47.470]Now I'm breaking through the tempered glass.
{"此刻我正击碎钢化玻璃"}
[01:50.220]Set aside my doubts, won't hesitate.
{"抛下疑虑　不再犹豫"}
[01:52.470]I've been waiting through all of my life.
{"我这一生都在等待"}
[01:55.870]From today, I've buried it away.
{"从今天起　我已将其埋葬"}
[01:58.320]In the end, I just might have to face
{"最终　或许我必须面对"}
[02:01.680]Something new with every passing day.
{"日复一日的新事物"}
[02:07.590]Now there's nowhere to run to.
{"如今已无处可逃"}
[02:11.290]I'm feeling alive,
{"我感受到生命律动"}
[02:13.340]Revived with a second chance to live.
{"重获新生的第二次机会"}
[02:17.040]Brand new days come and go.
{"崭新的日子来了又去"}
[02:20.950]So, if we let time
{"所以　如果我们任由时间"}
[02:23.650]Slip by for eternity...
{"永远悄然流逝……"}
[02:25.850]Small regrets will always add
{"微小的遗憾终将累积"}
[02:28.850]Up to something too big if given time.
{"假以时日便成无法承受之重"}
[02:31.840]What do we do in adversity?
{"逆境中我们该如何自处？"}
[02:36.300]Even if I take a fall,
{"即便我会跌倒失败"}
[02:38.550]Tumbling down without time for a pause,
{"不断坠落却无暇停歇，"}
[02:41.210]I know that I will become...
{"我深知自己终将成为…"}
[02:45.690]Someone's who's learned to be wiser, a bit of a fighter.
{"一个学会更睿智的人，带着几分斗士的锋芒。"}
[02:48.750]I can make right what had been wrong.
{"我能将曾经的错误一一纠正。"}
[02:51.000]Though I can't be perfect, it'll be worth it.
{"虽无法臻至完美，但这一切都值得。"}
[02:54.150]I'll keep on trying and trying.
{"我会持续尝试，永不言弃。"}
[02:57.050]Without resistance, I'll make a difference.
{"毫无保留地，我将创造改变。"}
[02:59.150]Even mistakes will never stop me.
{"纵使犯错也无法阻挡我的脚步。"}
[03:03.250]Only then, this world can find a new beginning in time.
{"唯有那时，这世界才能迎来崭新的开端。"}
[03:30.870]Someone's who's learned to be wiser, a bit of a fighter.
{"一个学会更睿智的人，带着几分斗士的锋芒。"}
[03:33.650]I can make right what had been wrong.
{"我能将曾经的错误一一纠正。"}
[03:35.650]Though I can't be perfect, it'll be worth it.
{"虽无法臻至完美，但这一切都值得。"}
[03:39.150]I'll keep on trying and trying.
{"我会持续尝试，永不言弃。"}
[03:41.500]I'll shout just a bit louder, fight a bit harder.
{"我要呐喊得更加响亮，战斗得更加顽强。"}
[03:44.550]I will go on. I'm undefeated.
{"我将继续前行。我永不言败。"}
[03:46.610]Can't feel the hunger. I won't go under.
{"感受不到饥渴。我绝不会沉沦。"}
[03:50.310]I'm my own person. I feel it.
{"我是自己的主宰。我深切感知。"}
[03:53.460]Little bit stronger, going on farther.
{"更坚强一点，走得更远一点。"}
